---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="HabitTrack Privacy Policy: 100% private, client-side only habit tracker. No accounts, no servers, no analytics, and zero tracking."
>
  <article class="max-w-none">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center sm:text-left border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-purple-900/50 pb-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-950/60 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-green-200 dark:border-green-800/60 mb-3">
        Zero Data Collection
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-50">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-200/80 leading-relaxed">
        Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-700 dark:text-purple-100/90 leading-relaxed">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/30 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/50 text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-200 text-sm sm:text-base">
        <strong>Summary:</strong> HabitTrack does not collect, transmit, share, or sell any of your data. Everything you input stays on your physical device in your browser's local database.
      </div>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">1. Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
        <p>
          Unlike traditional productivity applications, HabitTrack operates strictly without a backend server or database. We do not collect:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-sm sm:text-base">
          <li>Personal identification info (names, emails, passwords)</li>
          <li>Habit entries, schedules, titles, or descriptions</li>
          <li>Daily completion statuses, streaks, or scores</li>
          <li>IP addresses, geolocation, or device fingerprints</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">2. Where Your Data is Stored</h2>
        <p>
          Your data is stored locally in your web browser using modern web standards:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-sm sm:text-base">
          <li><strong>IndexedDB (via Dexie.js):</strong> Stores your habit names, order positions, and daily completion logs.</li>
          <li><strong>localStorage:</strong> Stores your visual theme preference (light mode or dark purple mode).</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          This data remains permanently on your device until you choose to delete individual habits or clear your browser's site data.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">3. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
        <p>
          HabitTrack uses <strong>zero cookies</strong> and does not load any third-party tracking scripts, advertising SDKs, or invasive telemetry frameworks. We do not use Google Analytics, Meta Pixel, or any behavioral profiling tools.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">4. Third-Party CDN Resources</h2>
        <p>
          To maintain optimal performance and typography, this application loads font assets directly from Google Fonts via CDN. No personal identifiers or habits are ever transmitted to Google during asset retrieval.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">5. How to Delete Your Data</h2>
        <p>
          You have 100% control over your data at all times:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-sm sm:text-base">
          <li><strong>Delete habits:</strong> Click the three dots (⋮) on any habit and select "Delete" to erase that habit and all its history.</li>
          <li><strong>Wipe everything:</strong> Clear your browser's cookies and site data for this domain to purge all IndexedDB tables.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          If we ever update this policy, the changes will be reflected directly on this page with an updated modification date. Because we do not collect email addresses, we encourage reviewing this page periodically.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
